  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">German JPO for the Movable Heritage and Museums</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scope of the German JPO for the Movable Heritage and Museums is to assist in the implementation of the 1970 Convention and of the 2015 Recommendation on Museums and collections. In addition, the JPO will assist in managing projects related to the 1970 Convention funded by various resources, providing inputs to files concerning museums, contributing to fundraising initiatives, and undertaking additional activities that may be required, both for ensuring the success of the work of the team and for professional development of the JPO.</narrative>
  </description>
